        "FC-S-0d3e35eb30b2abf7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "GP-006-FC-92657c282e617e5c",
      "text": "Next, we used Luc LNPs to evaluate mRNA expression levels in hepatocytes and LSECs, respectively.",
